Description: Markdown previewer and editor for GNOME Files
 Preview Markdown in a resizable Nautilus side pane or a standalone GTK window.
 Includes syntax-highlighted editing, live document updates, tables, images,
 highlighted code, and optional network-backed equation typesetting.
